        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TC201 Global Door Controls Door Grade 1 Surface Mount Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC201 Door Closers provide narrow styling and installation versatility. They are ideal \r\nfor use with aluminum doors and frames, yet it make an attractive installation on wood or metal doors. \r\nThey fit a common 9-1/6\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern and packaged complete with wood and machine screws. Direct fit replacement for Norton 1600 series door closers. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe TC201 is the highest rating <b>Grade 1</b> certified and has a <b>25 Year Warranty</b>. \r\nThey are non handed and, for standard non-hold open or hold open applications. They can be \r\nmounted on regular and top jamb installations. An optional mounting bracket is available for parallel installations. UL listed R7483 615R for \"A\" label fire doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/tc201ada-global-grade-1-ada-compliant-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>Grade 1 ADA Compliant Closer</b></a></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features</b> Global TC201 Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 258 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 48\" interior / 42\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Grade 1 (Highest Grade)</b></li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved (UL R7483 615R)</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 3-6</li>\r\n<li><b>25 Year Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC201_Installation_Instructions.pdf?v=1704262174\" target=\"new\"><b>TC201 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC201-size.pdf?v=1704262173\" target=\"new\"><b>Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf desired, you can add an optional <a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\">Parallel Arm Bracket PAB-2200 and / or Optional Hold Open Arm HOA-1245</a> below.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/global-tc2200-arms.jpg?v=1704354566\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories Arms\"></a>\r\n</p>",
